# CQ1 – Which artists in the Tate collection were born in the Netherlands?
PREFIX schema: <http://schema.org/>
PREFIX wd:     <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>
SELECT ?artist ?name ?birthPlace WHERE {
  ?artist schema:name ?name ;
          schema:birthPlace ?birthPlace .
  ?birthPlace schema:containedInPlace* wd:Q55 .    # Q55 = Netherlands; * also matches the country itself
}
ORDER BY ?name
